+# Bug Fix: Preserve deleted-customer orders and fix order pagination
+
+- **Slug**: ticket
+- **Fixed**: 2026-11-18T21:45:10+00:00
+- **Assessment**: ./assessment.md
+- **Status**: applied
+
+## Summary
+
+Private customer-order lookup now queries retained order customer ids even after the customer row is deleted, attaching a customer only when it still exists. Order list responses preserve totals on empty pages, use correct ceiling page counts, and group name/phone filters correctly.
+
+## Changes
+
+| File | Change | Notes |
+|------|--------|-------|
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/order/OrderApi.java` | modified | Customer-order endpoint no longer returns 404 for a missing customer; it queries by `customerId` and leaves the customer field null when deleted. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/controller/order/facade/OrderFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Empty pages now return an empty list with repository `recordsTotal` and `totalPages`. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/repositories/order/OrderRepositoryImpl.java` | modified | Parenthesized OR filter clauses so all filters remain scoped to the store and other criteria. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/utils/RepositoryHelper.java` | modified | Corrected new-pagination total pages to ceiling division. |
+| `sm-core/src/test/java/com/salesmanager/test/business/utils/RepositoryHelperTest.java` | added test | Pins down zero-based page offsets and exact-multiple page totals. |
+
+## Diff Highlights
+
+- Customer order lookup builds `OrderCriteria` with `customerId`, page, and count before optionally loading the live customer.
+- Empty result pages retain the count from the count query rather than replacing it with zero.
+- `totalPages` is now `(count + pageSize - 1) / pageSize`.
+
+## Tests Added or Updated
+
+- `com.salesmanager.test.business.utils.RepositoryHelperTest#newPaginationUsesZeroBasedPagesAndCeilingTotalPages` — verifies page 1 starts at offset 25 for page size 25 and 50 records report 2 pages.
+
+## Local Verification
+
+- Commands run: `mvn -pl sm-core -am -Dtest=RepositoryHelperTest -Dsurefire.failIfNoSpecifiedTests=false test` → passed; 1 test, 0 failures.
+- Commands run: `mvn -pl sm-shop -am -DskipTests package` → passed; changed `sm-shop` sources compiled and packaged.
+- Manual checks: reviewed the retained order fields and existing order-detail path; no HTTP/database fixture was available for end-to-end execution.
+
+## Deviations from Assessment
+
+The planned endpoint integration tests were not added because the existing `OrderApiIntegrationTest` is ignored and the repository has no ready order/customer HTTP fixture. The production changes remain within the assessed paths, with one focused pagination unit test added.
+
+## Follow-ups
+
+- Add an enabled integration fixture for customer deletion, historical order retrieval, filtering, pagination, and email re-registration.
